    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάσις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drawing up, traction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				882b27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drawing in, suction</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς τροφῆς
				ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				693a17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάσει πίνειν</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάψει, κάψει</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				595a9
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίσπασις</span>
			, cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσις</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.11
			</span></i>.</div>
